ROS 2 message and service types for Asterism (Asterism::ROS).

Each .rb file here was generated by Asterism's tools/asterism_msggen.rb
from the ROS 2 Jazzy definition it names (packages std_msgs,
geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs, builtin_interfaces, service_msgs,
example_interfaces). The definitions are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt), and so are these files.
Copyright in the definitions belongs to their authors (Open Source
Robotics Foundation, Inc. and the ROS 2 contributors).

The definitions come from https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces
(std_msgs, geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs), https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces
(builtin_interfaces, service_msgs) and https://github.com/ros2/example_interfaces,
as distributed with ROS 2 Jazzy. Each file states its package and license at
its top. The asterism repository (https://github.com/ruby-asterism/asterism)
keeps the definitions themselves (tools/ros2_jazzy) and the generator; its
own code is under the MIT License.
